[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/comments/845044337","html_url":"https://github.com/sveltejs/kit/issues/1501#issuecomment-845044337","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/1501","id":845044337,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg0NTA0NDMzNw==","user":{"login":"deepmouse","id":39153505,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MTUzNTA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39153505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepmouse","html_url":"https://github.com/deepmouse","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepmouse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepmouse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepmouse/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepmouse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepmouse/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepmouse/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepmouse/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepmouse/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepmouse/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-05-20T12:12:43Z","updated_at":"2021-05-20T12:24:35Z","body":"As I explained in the discussion  I was passing a string with spaces as a file name and escaped it with `encodeURIComponent`:\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n        const path = `/articles/recipe/${encodeURIComponent(recipe.name)}.md`\r\n        article = await fetch(browser ? path : `${assets}${path}`)\r\n```\r\n\r\nAs `recipe.name` is a user-submitted string, I want to prevent path traversal etc. This might be relevant for debugging.\r\n\r\nIt seems that Svelte tries to escape an already escaped string. I am not quite sure if I am supposed to escape the URL component myself before passing it into `fetch` (for the record, I think I should?) - but either way - on the browser side t